MODULE SRLATCH

IMPORT MUX

INPUT S
INPUT R

INPUT RESET

OUTPUT Q
OUTPUT QB

WIRE TEMP1
WIRE TEMP2
WIRE TEMP3
WIRE TEMP4

HIGH ONE

MUX M1 S ONE RESET S
MUX M2 R ONE RESET R 


OR O2 S TEMP3 TEMP4
NOT N2 TEMP4 TEMP1
OR O1 R TEMP1 TEMP2
NOT N1 TEMP2 TEMP3


OR O4 S TEMP3 TEMP4
NOT N4 TEMP4 TEMP1
OR O3 R TEMP1 TEMP2
NOT N3 TEMP2 TEMP3

BUF BU1 TEMP3 Q
BUF BU2 TEMP1 QB

